This Repository can be found here: https://github.com/pbigalke/data_preparation_EWC.git
It contains code to generate 2 different timeseries datasets: the random timeseries (see /timeseries_data_preparation) 
and one that is labelled with hail information (see /constructing_labelled_dataset).

**/constructing_labelled_dataset**
Contains all the code to generate labelled MSG timeseries by matching with the MWCCH-overpasses and crop over the hail areas.
Note: There is another README file in here that explains it a bit more detailed.

**/data_buckets_IO**
Contains scripts to read from and write to the S3 data buckets from the European Weather Cloud.

**/helpers**
Contains some helper functions to convert datetime to strings and to match different data to each other.

**/readers**
Contains methods to read and extract information for different data sources.

**/timeseries_data_preparation**
Contains all the code to generate random MSG timeseries. 
Note: There is another README file in here that explains it a bit more detailed.